    a: 'Yes. International brands can register and verify a RedNote Professional Account (Blue V) using their overseas business license and trademark documentation. We handle all translation, compliance paperwork, and submission with RedNote, unlocking commercial features such as Juguang advertising, Pugongying creator booking, and in-app store integration.',
